                                                        <p class="brfprofile">

                                                            <b>Brief Profile:</b>

                                                            Dr. Sadhana Tiwari, Professor/Dean- International Business at GNIOT Institute of Management Studies, Greater Noida, has a robust portfolio of published research papers in various National and International journals and edited books. She has presented her work at numerous national and international conferences and conducted seminars and workshops focusing on Supply Chain Management and Data Mining Methods. Additionally, she has developed training content for probationary officers of Nationalised Banks. Dr. Tiwari has over 18 years of experience, including 10+ years in academics and 8 years in corporates. Her qualifications include a Ph.D. in Management, M.Sc. in Mathematics, MBA in Finance, and PGDFM. Major certifications include Six Sigma from the Ministry of Small and Medium Enterprises (MSME), Government of India, Google certification in Digital Marketing, and DUCAT certification in Data Mining techniques using R.

                                                        </p>

